Here is a neat little trick I found, I don't think it's
common knowledge.

LOOK OUT! SPOILERS BELOW


If you can handle whatever it is that the gods didn't
want (ie you have poison resistence) and manage not to
eat the whole thing (ie almost full) you can sacrifice
"the partially eaten XXXXXXX" and in my experience
the gods will always take it. I guess its like
"will you eat it if I try some first?" Just be careful
that you don't choke to death.

